 34P  c  2015Ch56: A 215-MeV {+36}S beam was produced using the combination of  
 34P 2c  XTU tandem Van de Graaff accelerator and ALPI superconducting linear   
 34P 3c  accelerator at the INFN Legnaro National Laboratory. The target was    
 34P 4c  300-|mg/cm{+2} 99.7% enriched {+208}Pb on a 20 |mg/cm{+2} carbon       
 34P 5c  backing. Projectile-like fragments produced in multinucleon binary     
 34P 6c  grazing reactions were separated and identified by the PRISMA          
 34P 7c  spectrometer. |g rays were detected using the CLARA array of 22        
 34P 8c  EUROBALL escape-suppressed HPGe clover detectors. Doppler corrections  
 34P 9c  of |g-ray energies were performed event by event. Measured E|g, I|g,   
 34P Ac  ({+34}P)|g-coin, and |g|g-coin. Deduced levels, J, |p. Comparisons with
 34P Bc  shell-model calculations.                                              
 34P  c  2019Gr08: A 225-MeV {+36}S beam was provided by Tandem-ALPI accelerator
 34P 2c  complex at the INFN Legnaro National Laboratory. The target was 1      
 34P 3c  mg/cm{+2} 99.7% enriched {+208}Pb with 1 mg/cm{+2} Nb backing and      
 34P 4c  mounted onto the Cologne differential plunger. Projectile-like         
 34P 5c  fragments produced in binary grazing reactions were separated and      
 34P 6c  identified by the PRISMA spectrometer. |g rays were detected using the 
 34P 7c  AGATA demonstrator array of five triple cluster modules of 36-fold     
 34P 8c  segmented Ge crystals covering backward angles from 135|' to 175|'.    
 34P 9c  Doppler corrections of |g-ray energies were performed event by event.  
 34P Ac  Measured E|g, ({+34}P)|g-coin, and level lifetimes using the           
 34P Bc  differential recoil-distance method (DRDM). Comparisons with           
 34P Cc  shell-model calculations.                                              
